<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Guglielmino degli Ubertini</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1289</span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Guglielmino degli Ubertini was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bishop">bishop</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arezzo">Arezzo</a> from 1248 to 1289 and the leading Ghibelline figure in the city, ruling much of its territory as a feudal lord. Allied with the Ghibelline faction of Tuscany, he led Arezzo against Guelph <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florence">Florence</a> and was killed fighting at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-campaldino">Battle of Campaldino</a> in 1289.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/guglielmino-degli-ubertini.jpg" alt="Guglielmino degli Ubertini" width="320" height="367" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Francesco Allegrini · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guglielmino_Ubertini.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
